{
  "job_B9.2.4_20251003_114951": {
    "chunk_text": "fter \u00fe\u00e6m Per\u00f0ica, \u00fee \u00fea l\u00e6ssan Asiam h\u00e6fde, angan winnan wi\u00f0 Ariarata, Capadoca cyninge, \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m Antigones & Per\u00f0ica gebeotedan \u00fe\u00e6t hie woldon him betweonum gefeohtan, & longe On \u00fe\u00e6m anbide Perdica for mid firde an Egyptum, \u00fe\u00e6r Tholomeus w\u00e6s se cyning, for \u00feon \u00f0e him \u00dea gegaderade Pholomeus micle fird ongean him. \u00dea hwile \u00fee hie tog\u00e6dereweard fundedon, gefuhton twegen cyningas Neoptolomus & Umenis. & he Umenis gefliemde Neoptolomus, \u00fe\u00e6t he com to Antigone \u00fe\u00e6m cyninge, & hiene spon \u00fe\u00e6t he \u00dea sende Antigones hiene selfne & his o\u00feerne \u00feegn Polipercon mid micle fultume \u00fe\u00e6t hie hiene \u00dea geascade \u00fe\u00e6t Umenis, & fors\u00e6tade hie \u00f0\u00e6r \u00f0\u00e6r hie ge\u00feoht h\u00e6fdon \u00fe\u00e6t hie hiene bes\u00e6tedon; & \u00c6fter \u00f0\u00e6m gefeaht Perdica & Ptholomeus & \u00fe\u00e6r wear\u00fe Perdica ofslagen. \u00c6fter \u00f0\u00e6m wear\u00f0 M\u00e6cedonium cu\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t Eumen & Pison & Ilirgus & Alceta, Perdican bro\u00f0or, On \u00f0\u00e6m gefeohte gefliemde Antigones Umenis, & hiene bedraf into anum f\u00e6stenne, & hiene \u00f0\u00e6r \u00dea sende Umenis to Antipatre \u00fe\u00e6m cyninge, & hiene fultumes b\u00e6d. \u00dea Antigones \u00fe\u00e6t angeat, \u00fea forlet he \u00fe\u00e6t setl. Ac he Umenis him wende from Antigones hamf\u00e6relte micelra untreow\u00f0a, & him to fultume \u00dea on",
